    "title": "Get reusable notebook widget",
    "category": "Notebooks",
    "description": "Get a reusable widget's current version and input contract before adding it to a notebook. The contract lists logical slots and required output columns. Use notebooks-widget-attach to bind those slots to local notebook dataframes. Different dataframe names need only a source binding, not Hog. Add a Hog mapping only when column names, column types, order, or shape differ. Ask the user when units or meaning are ambiguous.",
